  "notes": "{日替|ひが}わり is most commonly seen in restaurant contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {日替|ひが}わりランチ (daily lunch special)\n- {日替|ひが}わりメニュー (daily changing menu)\n- {日替|ひが}わり{定食|ていしょく} (daily set meal)\n- {日替|ひが}わり{弁当|べんとう} (daily bento)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {週替|しゅうが}わり: weekly special\n- {本日|ほんじつ}の: today's (special)\n- おすすめ: recommendation\n\nWRITING:\n- Can also be written as {日|ひ}{替|がわ}り with okurigana.",
